   "subject": "Extract results Specific Group",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "For a lavaan extention I am currently building, it would be conventient to do the following.<br><br>If there is a fit object that contains results for multiple groups, extract a fit object that looks like a single group object for a particular group. So, something like this:<br><br><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">HS.model <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-style:inherit\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(32,121,77);font-style:inherit\">&#39; visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,59,79);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html#cb11-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-color:rgb(108,117,125)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html%23cb11-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw25hAvTPkSjibQMxIeWnWrF\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(32,121,77);font-style:inherit\">              textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,59,79);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html#cb11-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-color:rgb(108,117,125)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html%23cb11-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01c0yIZF7varwe-E2vR7EV\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(32,121,77);font-style:inherit\">              speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9 &#39;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,59,79);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html#cb11-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-color:rgb(108,117,125)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html%23cb11-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3w1Q4eLWfXHHUhRw0uRWht\"></a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,59,79);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html#cb11-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-color:rgb(108,117,125)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html%23cb11-5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28cStnT5I3AsvmVG2zMdGx\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(94,94,94);font-style:inherit\"># configural invariance</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,59,79);font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><a href=\"https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html#cb11-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration-color:rgb(108,117,125)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lavaan.ugent.be/tutorial/groups.html%23cb11-6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fXLEpaxnobIzs002P_KZi\"></a>fit1 <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-style:inherit\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(71,88,171);font-style:inherit\">cfa</span>(HS.model, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(101,116,34);font-style:inherit\">data =</span> HolzingerSwineford1939, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(101,116,34);font-style:inherit\">group =</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(32,121,77);font-style:inherit\">&quot;school&quot;</span>)</span><br><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">## new function</span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\">fit2 &lt;- extractGroup(fit1, group = 1)<br></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,59,79);text-decoration-line:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14.875px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgba(233,236,239,0.65)\"><br></span></div><div>fit2 should then look like as if HS.model was only fit one group 1. So, don&#39;t look like a multiple group model.</div><div><br></div><div>Is that possible?</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "vU52-V4CAQAJ",
   "from": "Terrence Jorgensen",
   "author": "3fe90052fbf2f899",
   "date": "2024-06-11T09:56:50Z",
   "subject": "Re: Extract results Specific Group",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div>fit2 should then look like as if HS.model was only fit one group 1. So, don&#39;t look like a multiple group model.</div><div>Is that possible?</div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div>Anything is possible, but no, not in any convenient or realistic way.  All the relevant internal slots of a lavaan-class object are organized as lists (1 per block, which can be multiple groups, levels, or a combination).  If you have no constraints across groups, you should be able to write a function that simply re-fits the model to the selected group, for example:</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">group &lt;- 1</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">gdat &lt;- lavInspect(fit1, &quot;data&quot;)[[group]]</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">fit2 &lt;- update(fit1, data = gdat, group = NULL)</font><br></div><div><br></div><div>But as soon as cross-group constraints are involved, then <font face=\"Courier New\">fit2</font> won&#39;t have the same results as group 1&#39;s results of <font face=\"Courier New\">fit1</font>.  </div><div>If you describe specifically what you would like to do in your extension, I might be able to recommend some decent hacks.</div><div><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px\"><div><p style=\"margin:0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">Terrence D. Jorgensen </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">   (he, him, his)</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\"><br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Furldefense.com%2Fv3%2F__http%3A%2Fwww.uva.nl%2Fprofile%2Ft.d.jorgensen__%3B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%24&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638536316050859803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=m0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%2F39ZSVK%2FOV6SuCMpY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Furldefense.com%2Fv3%2F__http%3A%2Fwww.uva.nl%2Fprofile%2Ft.d.jorgensen__%3B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%24&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638536316050859803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=m0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%2F39ZSVK%2FOV6SuCMpY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,120,215);text-decoration-line:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Furldefense.com%252Fv3%252F__http%253A%252Fwww.uva.nl%252Fprofile%252Ft.d.jorgensen__%253B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%2524%26data%3D05%257C02%257CT.D.Jorgensen%2540uva.nl%257C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%257Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%257C0%257C0%257C638536316050859803%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3Dm0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%252F39ZSVK%252FOV6SuCMpY%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414586149000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2MVgpd2ObSkkRCSSaabgcz\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</span></a></span></p></div></div><div> </div></div>"
